Fixed :meth:`vCalAddress.to_xcal() <icalendar.prop.cal_address.vCalAddress.to_xcal>` from writing characters that are disallowed in XML. The value now goes through the same filter as the text and URI types, and that filter also removes ``U+FFFE`` and ``U+FFFF``. I used AI (Claude Opus 5.5, via Claude Code) to find this bug, write the fix, and write its tests; I reviewed and validated the output. @alhudz
